      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate care led by Dr. Cruz"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently commend the exceptional dedication, warmth, and clinical expertise of Dr. Phil Cruz and his support team. Clients appreciate the courteous front desk reception and skilled technicians, noting that the entire staff goes above and beyond, even staying after closing hours to accommodate urgent surgical procedures."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 18,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle and affectionate pet handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize the genuine love and tenderness shown to family dogs, cats, and puppies throughout every exam. Clients note that staff members handle anxious pets with great patience and comfort nervous animals during urgent care and recovery. Many families report trusting the practice with multiple generations of pets."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Thorough explanations and patient listening"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients highlight the clinic transparent communication and prompt responses to questions and emails. Multiple pet owners appreciate that Dr. Cruz takes ample time to explain medical conditions, surgical options, and post-operative home care, ensuring owners feel fully informed without ever feeling pressured."
      }
    }
  ],
